  "judgment": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "reasoning": "The current authoritative notation uses zero-width fraction bars inside parentheses, representing binomial coefficients. This resolves the earlier fraction-based disagreement. For q-70313, the value is 7!/(3!4!)=35. For q-113611, Pascal's identity gives binom(6,4)=binom(5,3)+binom(5,4), so the missing expression is binom(5,3), equal to 10. Both answers agree with their own captured worked solutions.",
